/T (Here, sincere traditional methods of water conservation, like rainwater harvesting or spring management, are often insufficient to meet growing needs. The main water problem starts in early May and continues till July. This period of water scarcity severely impacts crop yields, as many farmers rely heavily on monsoon precipitation for irrigation. )
