/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 199 0 R
/T (Water scarcity is a major problem for farmers in Madhya Pradesh, especially during the peak summer months of May to July. This time of minimal rainfall makes it difficult for farmers to irrigate their crops. As a result, crop yields decrease, and farmers' incomes suffer. A 2021 Central Ground Water Board report found that 84 Madhya Pradesh blocks face severe water scarcity.)
/E (Water scarcity is a major problem for farmers in Madhya Pradesh, especially during the peak summer months of May to July. This time of minimal rainfall makes it difficult for farmers to irrigate their crops. As a result, crop yields decrease, and farmers' incomes suffer. A 2021 Central Ground Water Board report found that 84 Madhya Pradesh blocks face severe water scarcity.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
321 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 199 0 R
/T (Apart from the traditional concerns of water scarcity, recently the groundwater level has also rapidly declined due to irresponsible and irrational consumption of groundwater. This could lead to severe water problems in the future. )
/E (Apart from the traditional concerns of water scarcity, recently the groundwater level has also rapidly declined due to irresponsible and irrational consumption of groundwater. This could lead to severe water problems in the future. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
