<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 199 0 R
/T (The lack of adequate water for irrigation is a major challenge for farmers in Madhya Pradesh. The government is working to address this issue by implementing various water conservation measures. However, more needs to be done to ensure that farmers have access to the water they need to grow their crops. )
/E (The lack of adequate water for irrigation is a major challenge for farmers in Madhya Pradesh. The government is working to address this issue by implementing various water conservation measures. However, more needs to be done to ensure that farmers have access to the water they need to grow their crops. )
