/T (Many farmers in rural Madhya Pradesh rely solely on agriculture for their livelihood. However, due to factors like low agricultural productivity, erratic rainfall, and declining farm incomes, many farmers, especially small and marginal farmers, struggle to make a decent living. This lack of employment opportunities limits their income sources and makes them vulnerable to economic hardships.)
