648 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 212 0 R
/E (Ans: Yes, we face many problems with the water systems. The wells often run dry, especially during the summer months. The government pumps are unreliable and don't provide enough water for everyone. This makes it hard to irrigate our fields and grow enough crops to feed our families. Some farmers use the sprinkler system, but that is just too expensive for us.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [12]
>>
