656 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 213 0 R
/E (Ans: No, we are not aware of any such schemes implemented by the government. I don't think the government has even applied such schemes in this region. Recently the Narmada line was joined to some of the farms, but that was too only for the rich farmers. The government has supported dam formation on very small levels, which are of some help. They have also started providing information and training about Self Help Groups \(SHGs\) recently.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
657 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 213 0 R
/E (Ans: We've tried a few things to deal with the water shortage. Some farmers have dug deeper wells, but that's expensive and doesn't always work. We've also tried rainwater harvesting. This has helped during dry periods, but these too cannot sustain our fields through the farming season.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
