/P 214 0 R
/E (Ans: Yes, we face a lot of problems with water for both drinking and irrigation. For about 8 months in a year, we hardly have any water for our fields, which often leads to a lot of crop failure. This year our soybean crops failed due to a lack of water, causing us loss. Since we have no access to the Narmada line and the tank in our village is almost empty year-round, we only have a pool to provide us with which has also been dug by us.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [14]
>>
